<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-TURKEY 1 NETHERLANDS 0 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TURKEY 1 NETHERLANDS 0 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BURSA, Turkey 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey beat the Netherlands 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in their World Cup European group seven qualifying match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Hakan Sukur 52</p>
<p>    Standings    Pl  W   D   L   F   A Pts</p>
<p> Netherlands     5   4   0   1  17   3  12</p>
<p> Belgium	   4   3   0   1   7   5   9</p>
<p> Turkey	    4   2   1   1   9   2   7</p>
<p> Wales	     6   2   1   3  14  12   7</p>
<p> San Marino	5   0   0   5   0  25   0</p>
<p>Next matches: April 30 San Marino v Netherlands, Turkey v Belgium</p>
</text>
